SUMMARY:A Sacred Fire & Sound Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\n**🔥**Join David and Harry for an intim
 ate evening of fire\, prayer\, and sound healing at a **west Asheville** p
 rivate residence (Harry's Mystical Pathways) a sacred place nestled in Ash
 eville**🔥**\n🔥 Prayer & Intention\n🔥 Sacred Herbs & Resins\n🔥S
 acred Land\n🔥Astrology Transmission\n🔥 Transformational Fire Ceremon
 y\n🔥 Gong & Sound Journey\n🔥 Community & Connection\n\n**Reserve you
 r special spot here:** [Star Sounds](https://www.starsounds.love/event-det
 ails/a-sacred-fire-sound-ceremony?fbclid=IwY2xjawSb-2xleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicml
 kETFhSFN4ckJXV3FzVnc2QWhWc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHqjMTatx4
 OjDVexVTSlo8X3Nlgy7mRNRIsyQvYoIeg6v56cuJXK83CTCa63x_aem_hCQ66VaTXqYqwWPL9U
 hvzA)\n\nSince ancient times\, people have gathered around sacred fires to
  release burdens\, offer prayers\, seek guidance\, and connect with the de
 eper rhythms of life. Fire has always been more than heat and light. It is
  a living symbol of transformation\, capable of helping us release what is
  complete and strengthen what is ready to grow.\n**Throughout the evening\
 , each participant will be invited to engage directly with the fire throug
 h personal prayer and intention.** Whether offering gratitude\, seeking cl
 arity\, honoring a transition\, or releasing an old story\, the fire becom
 es a sacred ally in the process of transformation.\nThe ceremony will be e
 nhanced with the aromatic presence of sacred herbs and resins\, including 
 cedar\, frankincense\, copal\, rosemary\, and other plant allies tradition
 ally used for blessing\, purification\, protection\, and prayer. As these 
 offerings are placed into the fire\, their smoke carries our intentions sk
 yward while creating a rich sensory experience that connects us to the anc
 ient traditions of earth-based ceremony.\nThe evening will also **include 
 an immersive sound journey** featuring gongs\, singing bowls\, and other h
 ealing instruments. The sounds will help deepen relaxation\, open inner aw
 areness\, and support the energetic shifts initiated through prayer and fi
 re ceremony.\nSurrounded by the beauty of the Asheville mountains and the 
 quiet presence of nature\, this gathering offers a sacred space to slow do
 wn\, reconnect\, and remember what truly matters.\n\n**🔥Please bring a 
 comfortable chair or blanket\, water\, and clothing appropriate for the we
 ather.**\n\n**🔥Exact location and arrival details (East Asheville area)
  will be provided upon registration.**\n\nCome gather around the fire\, of
 fer your prayers\, and experience an evening of sound\, ceremony\, and tra
 nsformation beneath the stars.\n**Donations start at $33 Please give what 
 you can**\n**No one gets priced out\,** if you like to come and short on f
 unds\, just reach out to David @ [[david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@sta
 rsounds.love)]([mailto:david@starsounds.love](http://mailto:david@starsoun
 ds.love))\n\n**Reserve your special spot here:** [Star Sounds](https://www
